al) dari bumi, dengan pertumbuhan yang sungguh-sungguh sempurna,\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Nooh\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/71.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 17\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/71-17.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/71.html\">Surah Nooh</a> › Ayat 17</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Nooh 71:17</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَاللَّهُ أَنبَتَكُم مِّنَ الْأَرْضِ نَبَاتًا﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">“Dan Allah telah menumbuhkan kamu (hidup dari benda-benda yang berasal) dari bumi, dengan pertumbuhan yang sungguh-sungguh sempurna,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">بل قد يكون اسم مصدر أقيم مقامه<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/33</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s71a17\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/71-16.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (71:16)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/71-23.html\">Ayat seterusnya (71:23)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/71-23.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Nooh 71:23 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"“Dan (ketua-ketua) mereka (menghasut dengan) berkata: ‘Jangan kamu meninggalkan (penyembahan) tuhan-tuhan kamu, terutama (penyembahan) Wadd, dan Suwaa’, da\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/71-23.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Nooh 71:23 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"“Dan (ketua-ketua) mereka (menghasut dengan) berkata: ‘Jangan kamu meninggalkan (penyembahan) tuhan-tuhan kamu, terutama (penyembahan) Wadd, dan Suwaa’, da\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Nooh\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/71.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 23\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/71-23.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/71.html\">Surah Nooh</a> › Ayat 23</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Nooh 71:23</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَقَالُوا لَا تَذَرُنَّ آلِهَتَكُمْ وَلَا تَذَرُنَّ وَدًّا وَلَا سُوَاعًا وَلَا يَغُوثَ وَيَعُوقَ وَنَسْرًا﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">“Dan (ketua-ketua) mereka (menghasut dengan) berkata: ‘Jangan kamu meninggalkan (penyembahan) tuhan-tuhan kamu, terutama (penyembahan) Wadd, dan Suwaa’, dan Yaghuth, dan Ya&#x27;uuq, serta Nasr.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن هؤلاء كانوا قوما صالحين في قوم نوح. فلما ماتوا عكفوا على قبورهم ثم صوروهم ثم اتخذوا الأصنام على صورهم كما تقدم ذكر ذلك عن ابن عباس وغيره من علماء السلف.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 1/357</cite></blockquote><h3>Apa yang beliau nukilkan daripada orang lain</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عباس وغيره من السلف</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «أن هذه أسماء قوم صالحين، كانوا في قوم نوح، فلما ماتوا عكفوا على قبورهم، وصوروا تماثيلهم، ثم طال عليهم الأمد فعبدوهم»<cite>«اقتضاء الصراط المستقيم لمخالفة أصحاب الجحيم» 2/300</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عباس وغيره من السلف</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «أن هذه أسماء قوم صالحين، كانوا في قوم نوح، فلما ماتوا عكفوا على قبورهم، وصوروا تماثيلهم»<cite>«اقتضاء الصراط المستقيم لمخالفة أصحاب الجحيم» 2/300</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عباس وغيره</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «هؤلاء قوم صالحون كانوا في قوم نوح فلما ماتوا عكفوا على قبورهم ثم صوروا تماثيلهم فعبدوهم»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 1/151</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s71a23\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/71-17.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (71:17)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/71-28.html\">Ayat seterusnya (71:28)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/71-28.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Nooh 71:28 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"“Wahai Tuhanku! Ampunkanlah bagiku, dan bagi kedua ibu bapaku, serta bagi sesiapa yang masuk ke rumahku dengan keadaan beriman; dan (ampunkanlah) bagi seka\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/71-28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/71-28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/71-28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/71-28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/71-28.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"h